# Wavefront Material Template Library (.mtl)
# Configured for Robotic Arm Forearm Assembly (P4)

# ==========================================================
# MATERIAL 1: MATTE BLACK (Brackets, Outer Housing, Servos)
# ==========================================================
newmtl Matte_Black
Ka 0.05 0.05 0.05             # Deep dark ambient shadow baseline
Kd 0.12 0.12 0.12             # Flat, dark charcoal/black diffuse surface
Ks 0.03 0.03 0.03             # Subdued specular highlights to avoid high gloss
Ns 8.0                        # Low shininess exponent for a scattered, matte finish
Illum 2                       # Diffuse and specular shading turned on
d 1.0                         # Fully opaque solid

# ==========================================================
# MATERIAL 2: STAINLESS STEEL (Central Connective Hydraulic Shaft)
# ==========================================================
newmtl SS_Steel
Ka 0.22 0.24 0.26             # Slight cool metallic ambient undertone
Kd 0.68 0.70 0.72             # Bright silver/grey reflective base
Ks 0.90 0.90 0.90             # High intensity specular properties for polished steel look
Ns 128.0                      # High shininess exponent for sharp, tightly focused highlights
Illum 2                       # Diffuse and specular shading turned on
d 1.0                         # Fully opaque solid